Package: CompositeSEM
Type: Package
Title: A module to estimate composites (formative/emergent) constructs and latent variables
Version: 1.5.0
Author: Abdullah Alarfaj, Abdullah Alamer
Maintainer: Abdullah Alarfaj <Abdullah.Alarfaj@arfajgroup.com>
Description: Composite-SEM is a comprehensive module for jamovi designed to estimate, analyze, test, and study linear and multi-group structural equation models. Built upon the robust cSEM R package, this module brings professional-grade composite-based Structural Equation Modeling (SEM) to a user-friendly graphical interface.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports: jmvcore (>= 0.8.5), R6, cSEM, stats, utils
